<item><title>TUH Kitchen Dishwasher Replacement - Supply</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Suppliers are invited by the Townsville Hospital & Health Service to submit an offer for Invitation to Offer No. THHS128700-2 for the Supply and installation of a new kitchen dishwasher for Townsville University Hospital (TUH) as specified in Part B – Contract Details document.<br /><br />The scope of the potential Contract will cover the following requirements (see Part B: Contract Details, Schedule 1 Requirements for full details):<br /><br />•	Supply, installation and commissioning of two (2) new commercial dishwashers, each complete with:<br /><br />a.	Stripping conveyor to suit each machine<br /><br />b.	Cutlery magnet<br /><br />c.	Automatic tray collection system<br /><br />d.	Component of Tray Lowerators – enough for 800 trays<br /><br />•	Training and assistance for THHS operational and maintenance staff with new equipment. Allow for training during commission and start up as well as a follow up training sessions after 6 months operation<br /><br />•	Proposal for maintenance and servicing following 1...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Townsville Hospital and Health Service QLD<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Oct/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP526340<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Domestic & Consumer ELEC, Office Related Supplies & Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
