<item><title>Landslip Remediation Package 6 Soil Nail AGRN1012</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Nambucca Valley Council (NVC) is undertaking the remediation of multiple landslip sites affecting Council-managed transport infrastructure that sustained damage during the declared natural disaster events associated with Australian Government Disaster Recovery Funding Arrangements (DRFA) AGRN 1012 and AGRN 1025. To support the delivery of these works, BASEC Engineering has been engaged by Nambucca Valley Council to provide project management services and oversee the planning, procurement and delivery of the remediation program on Council's behalf.<br /><br />The scope of works under this contract includes:<br /><br />Remediation of 7 Landslips classified as medium to high risk<br /><br />o DM01072 - North Arm Rd CH10.9km AGRN1012<br /><br />o DM00849/DM01339 - North Arm Rd CH14.8km AGRN1012<br /><br />o DM01362/DM00950 - North Arm Rd CH27.1km AGRN1012<br /><br />o DM01052 - North Arm Rd CH31.2km AGRN1012<br /><br />o DM00939 - Upper Buckra Bendinni Rd CH2.3km AGRN1012<br /><br />o DM00946 - Upper Buckra Bendi...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Nambucca Valley Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 30/Oct/2026 10:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP526312<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Engineer, Research, Tech services, Environmental & Heritage Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 10]]></description>
