<item><title>UniSQ International Admissions</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The University of Southern Queensland (UniSQ) is seeking to procure a contemporary international admissions and education agent management solution, including implementation, configuration, data migration, integration, training, and ongoing support services.<br /><br />The proposed solution must support international coursework and higher degree by research (HDR) applications from submission through assessment, offer, acceptance and enrolment readiness, strengthen admissions integrity, privacy and security, and improve the applicant and education agent experience, while ensuring compliance with privacy, cyber security, audit and regulatory obligations.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> University of Southern Queensland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 06/Oct/2026 09:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP526320<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
