<item><title>Cleaning of Public Toilets and Park Facilities 2027-2030</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Contract is for the cleaning of walls, floors, ceilings, fixtures and fittings within the structure of public toilet blocks, picnic tables, dog waste bag dispensers and electric barbeques located in parks and other specified facilities, as set out in the attached Schedules for a period of 36 months from 1 January 2027, with an option for two (2) further twelve (12) month periods.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Scenic Rim Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP526309<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Cleaning Services, Equip, Supplies<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
