<item><title>EOI - Primary Care Service Partner (Clermont)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Expressions of Interest are sought by the Mackay Hospital and Health Service (MHHS) in relation to the provision and operation of comprehensive primary care services within the Clermont community. Clermont is a regional Queensland town situated approximately 290 kilometres south-west of Mackay and services a broader rural catchment across the Isaac Region. Prospective Suppliers must be suitably qualified and experienced organisations capable of partnering with MHHS to deliver sustainable, high-quality primary care services from MHHS-owned purpose-built, co-located consulting facilities.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Mackay Hospital and Health Service<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Oct/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP526301<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Dane Haddon Email: dane.haddon@health.qld.gov.au Tel: 0492968020<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Healthcare Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
