<item><title>27_016 Register of Pre-Qualified Services – Traffic Management Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Dear Valued Suppliers<br /><br />Southern Downs Regional Council invites suitably qualified and experienced Suppliers for the formation of a Register of Pre- Qualified Suppliers for Traffic Management Services. It is anticipated that successful Tenderer/s may be engaged to complete services at various locations throughout the region.<br /><br />Traffic management providers are utilised regularly by Southern Downs Regional Council to ensure public and worker safety on and around construction and maintenance sites throughout the region.<br /><br />This contract is for the supply of qualified, experienced and accredited traffic controllers, fully equipped signage vehicles, traffic control devices, communications systems and safety equipment for the control of vehicular and pedestrian traffic on, around and through the Principal’s work sites, whether static or mobile, and the protection of workers, construction plant and other property on or adjacent to the Principal’s work sites.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Southern Downs Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 13/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP517827<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Parking, Traffic Services & Equip, Signs & Barriers<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
