<item><title>Testing Orchestration, Automation, Support and Transition</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> WorkCover Queensland is seeking a Test Orchestration Platform and associated implementation, integration, transition and support services to establish an enterprise-wide testing capability. The solution will support testing governance, orchestration, automation, test data management, reporting, and assurance across WCQ's increasingly integrated SaaS and cloud-based technology landscape.<br /><br />The procurement includes three capability areas:<br /><br />Test Orchestration Platform<br /><br />- Enterprise test orchestration and management platform.<br /><br />- Software licensing for the proposed platform.<br /><br />- Test orchestration, workflow management, reporting, governance, traceability and release assurance capabilities.<br /><br />- Integration with testing tools, CI/CD pipelines, SaaS platforms, cloud services, enterprise applications and iPaaS.<br /><br />Testing and Test Data Capabilities<br /><br />- Test automation capabilities supporting UI, API, integration and contract testing.<br /><br />...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> WorkCover Queensland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 14/Oct/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP525810<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 12]]></description>
