</item>
<item><title>Supply of Railway Track Materials</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Scope: <br /><br />This Scope of Work applies to the design, manufacture, supply, documentation, testing evidence,<br /><br />packaging, delivery and support of rail fastenings and associated Goods identified in the<br /><br />Contract material list, as amended from time to time in accordance with the Contract, including<br /><br />any ‘Other Goods’ added under the relevant special condition.<br /><br />Rail fastenings must be adequately designed for all sleeper types used by Queensland Rail,<br /><br />including low profile concrete sleepers, full depth concrete sleepers, turnout concrete bearers,<br /><br />timber sleepers and timber or composite transoms.<br /><br />This Scope of Work includes, but is not limited to, rail foot insulators, rail pads, resilient clips,<br /><br />base plate assemblies, screw spikes, associated components, accessories, consumables and<br /><br />replacement items required to provide a complete and fit-for-purpose rail fastening system.<br /><br />Conformance with this Scope of...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland Rail<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 08/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP525152<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Michelle Mcdonald Email: michelle.mcdonald@qr.com.au Tel: NR<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Railway, Tramway and Track<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
