<item><title>RFT26-019 College Avenue Reconstruction</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City’s objectives with this Request for Tender are to engage a suitably qualified and experienced Contractor to design, reconstruct and resurface a 1.62 km section of College Avenue in Busselton. The existing pavement has asphalt surfacing with notable deterioration requiring a combination of reconstruction and resurfacing.<br /><br />This urban road supports high traffic volumes, and all works will be conducted at night to minimise disruption. A concept design, reconstruction methodology, and durable surfacing solution are required to withstand sustained traffic loading over a minimum 30-year design life.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Busselton<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 14/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+08:00) Perth time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP525381<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Construction & Operation, Parking, Traffic Services & Equip<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
