<item><title>NCR2627 015 - Program Scheduler</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Transport and Main Roads, North Coast Region, requires the services of a Program Scheduler to provide planning, scheduling, reporting and Primavera P6 expertise in support of the Significant Projects program. The engagement is for an initial two-year term, with two optional one-year extension periods available at TMR's discretion, subject to operational requirements and satisfactory supplier performance. The role will support the delivery of transport infrastructure projects through program scheduling, reporting, stakeholder engagement and scheduling governance activities.<br /><br />Please refer to the attached documents for further information.<br /><br />NTO 01 Uploaded on 16/09/2026<br /><br />NTO 02 Uploaded on 17/09/2026<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Transport and Main Roads-North Coast<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Sep/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP525211<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Engineer, Research, Tech services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
