<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City of Gold Coast (City) is seeking to engage a suitably qualified and experienced not-for-profit youth service provider to deliver youth programs for young people aged 12 to 17 years across designated community centres throughout the City. The services include after-school activities, Saturday sessions and school holiday programs that support the City’s youth priorities of Get Involved, Get Connected and Get Ahead.<br /><br />Tenderers must refer to LG31441126037 Short Form Goods and Services Quotation Form for full details of the procurement, submission requirements and evaluation criteria. Tenderers are also required to review and consider all seven (7) attachments issued with the Request for Quotation when preparing and submitting their Offer.<br /><br />All enquiries and requests for clarification must be submitted through the VendorPanel platform by the Supplier query cut-off date. Any responses, addenda or other procurement communications issued by the Principal will be distributed through VendorP...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City Of Gold Coast<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 08/Oct/2026 10:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP507048<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Community & Social Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 10]]></description>
