<item><title>25/26-540 Urban Forest Tree Planting</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City of Ballarat will provide a list of selected locations where the planting of trees is to occur. The contractor will be responsible for the sourcing and purchasing of all trees required as part of this contract. The contractor is required to determine the appropriate planting configuration using provided guidelines. Maintenance includes watering, weeding, pruning, insect/pathogen control, stake and tie replacement as required and reporting any loss/death of trees to the contract supervisor.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Ballarat<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 01/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524950<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
