<item><title>Request for Information - Electricity Retail Supply – Large Contestable Sites</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Sunwater is seeking responses to this Request for Information (RFI) for the provision of Electricity Retail Supply from suitably qualified electricity retailers to support the development of its future electricity procurement strategy for a portfolio of large contestable electricity connections associated with its regional pump station operations.<br /><br />Sunwater is considering a range of procurement options for electricity supply including traditional contracting arrangements and procurement models that support evolving renewable energy objectives. Respondents are invited to provide feedback on the practical implementation, benefits and risks associated with these approaches.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> SunWater<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Oct/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524905<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Shane Duran Email: shane.duran@sunwater.com.au Tel: 0731200207<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Utilities<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
