<item><title>Expression of Interest - Lease of the Lake Boga Catalina Cafe</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council invites expressions of interest (EOIs) from suitably qualified and experienced operators in a café/food outlet to enter into a lease agreement for the operation of the 'Catalina Museum Cafe' located in Lake Boga, Victoria.<br /><br />This is an exciting opportunity for a motivated operator to establish a high-quality café that offers a welcoming space for both visitors and locals to connect, relax, and enjoy quality food and coffee.<br /><br />Respondents may request a site inspection during business hours by contacting Council via email at tenders@swanhill.vic.gov.au or calling (03) 5036 2366.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Swan Hill Rural City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 02/Oct/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524584<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Travel & Tourism<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
