<item><title>FAIR Support and Maintenance</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Queensland Treasury (Customer) is seeking submissions from suitably qualified suppliers to provide ongoing support, maintenance, managed services and development services for the Financial Assurance Information Registry (FAIR).<br /><br />FAIR is a business-critical application built on the Appian low-code enterprise platform. The system supports the administration of the Queensland Government's Financial Provisioning Scheme and integrates with external agency systems and Treasury's SAP financial management system.<br /><br />The required services include:<br /><br />•	Tier 1 to Tier 4 application support and incident management.<br /><br />•	Monitoring and resolution of system issues and errors.<br /><br />•	Appian platform and environment support, including upgrades and liaison with Appian.<br /><br />•	Ongoing application development and enhancements (approximately eight development days per month).<br /><br />•	Management of code releases across environments and support for production deployments.<br /><b...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland Treasury<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Oct/2026 11:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524360<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 11]]></description>
