<item><title>Slope Stabilisation &amp; Riparian Works at Various City Wide Locations - MARKET SOUNDING</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Slope Stabilisation & Riparian Works at Various City Wide Locations – Market Sounding <br /><br />Purpose of market sounding<br /><br />The Council of the City of Gold Coast (the City or Principal) is preparing to release a tender package for the scope as outlined in the documents. This market engagement process is intended to assist the City in refining project requirements and gaining a better understanding of industry capability and capacity to deliver the City's 12-month, 4-year, and future 10-year capital program for slope stabilisation works.<br /><br />This process will also help to inform the development of a sustainable and efficient long-term delivery program for slope stabilisation and riparian projects. <br /><br />This exercise aims to:<br /><br />•	provide forward notice to industry; <br /><br />•	understand current market capability and capacity; <br /><br />•	identify emerging suppliers and specialist contractors; <br /><br />•	seek feedback on appropriate procurement and delivery models; <br ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City Of Gold Coast<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 02/Oct/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524374<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Environmental & Heritage Services, Marine Transp. Products & Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
