</item>
<item><title>ITT269 - Redevelopment Kawana Aquatic Centre - Construction Stage 3</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Sunshine Coast Council has engaged a specialist design team to prepare the design and construction documentation for Stages 1 to 4 of the Kawana Aquatic Centre Redevelopment. With Stages 1 and 2 now complete, Council is seeking submissions from suitably qualified Principal Contractors to undertake the Kawana Aquatic Centre Redevelopment – Construction Stage 3 works.<br /><br />Stage 3 of the redevelopment will involve the resurfacing of the existing 25-metre pool, construction of a new storage facility, and upgrades to the centre's mechanical and electrical infrastructure.<br /><br />The successful Principal Contractor will be required to supply all materials, plant, equipment and labour necessary to undertake and complete all activities associated with the scope of works under this Contract. This includes carrying out all tasks, operations and associated services required to deliver the works in accordance with the specified requirements and to a satisfactory standard.<br /><br />Given the facility will rema...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 29/Sep/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524142<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 22]]></description>
