<item><title>MidCoast Council Green Waste Processing Tender Waste Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> MidCoast Council is seeking an experienced contractor to provide as-required on-site shredding, grinding, screening and processing of Garden and Green Waste Organics at the following Waste Management Centres:<br /><br />- Tuncurry, Midge Orchid Road, Darawank<br /><br />- Tea Gardens, Transfer Close, Tea Gardens<br /><br />- Gloucester, 385 Thunderbolts Way, Gloucester<br /><br />- Bulahdelah, Recovery Road, Bulahdelah<br /><br />- Stroud, Simmsville Road, Stroud<br /><br />The Contractor will process accumulated green waste into the Product Grades specified in the tender documents and form separate, safe and surveyable stockpiles or windrows. Council, or its appointed survey provider, will measure accepted processed material using drone surveying and Council’s Propeller platform.<br /><br />Pricing will be based on an all-inclusive rate per accepted surveyed cubic metre for each Facility and Product Grade.<br /><br />The proposed Contract term is two years, with three optional one-year extensions exercisable...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> MidCoast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 02/Oct/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524141<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Mining & Quarrying & Oil & Gas, Waste Management & Landfill<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
