<item><title>Developing and Conducting a Service Review Program</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The NSW Office of Local Government’s Integrated, Planning & Reporting (IP&R) framework supports Council in establishing service levels, monitoring service performance, and improving service delivery. The IP&R Guidelines for Local Government in NSW require Council to identify areas of service that it will review during its term, and how it will engage with the community and other stakeholders to determine service level expectations and appropriate measures. Council will undertake service reviews to identify opportunities to improve its operations and the services it provides to the community. <br /><br />Council is seeking Request for Quotations (RFQ) from appropriately qualified and experienced consultancy firms (Consultant) to work in partnership with Council to undertake service delivery reviews.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Forbes Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524149<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Management Advisory Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.com.au/tsi.axd?id=c21c50ff4dfe456999593e269da1686es524149s9b84ae7c1e7b4f3397a4dccd2ceae4fbs1583</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">c21c50ff4dfe456999593e269da1686e</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 23:01:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Management Advisory Services</category>
</item>
<item><title>Forward Procurement Notice - Toowoomba Regional Council - Southern Water Treatment Plant Project</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Forward Procurement Notice #1<br /><br />Toowoomba Regional Council - Southern Water Treatment Plant Project – Design and Construction Contractor<br /><br />Toowoomba Regional Council (Council) is providing advance notice of its intention to approach the open market to engage a suitably qualified and experienced Design and Construct (D&C) contractor to support the delivery of the main works for the Southern Water Treatment Plant Project (Project).<br /><br />This is the first of two forward procurement notices that Council intends to issue through VendorPanel ahead of the formal Expression of Interest (EOI) process. These notices are intended to raise market awareness and provide prospective respondents with sufficient time to understand the opportunity, assess their capability and capacity, establish appropriate delivery partnerships and allocate resources in preparation for the EOI process.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Toowoomba Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 29/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524127<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
