<item><title>001030 Road Infrastructure Investigation and Design PSA</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Preferred Supplier Arrangement seeks to establish panels of suitably qualified consultants to provide road infrastructure investigation, testing, design and specialist engineering services across the City of Moreton Bay. Services may include traffic surveys, geotechnical investigations, pavement testing, pavement engineering design, road condition assessments, road safety audits, RPEQ certification and other specialist advisory services. The arrangement is intended to provide Council with access to experienced consultants capable of delivering practical, evidence-based and value-for-money outcomes for the planning, renewal, rehabilitation and management of road infrastructure assets. Engagements will be undertaken on an as-required basis through project-specific work packages, quotations or requests for services issued under the arrangement.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Moreton Bay<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 30/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523899<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Engineer, Research, Tech services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 10]]></description>
