<item><title>VP523085 Mullers Lagoon - Stage 1 Foothpath Construction</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Whitsunday Regional Council (Principal) is seeking a suitably experienced, qualified and appropriately licensed Contractor to construct the first stage of the Mullers Lagoon Masterplan footpath network (Works) at Mullers Lagoon, The Soldiers Road, Bowen (Site).<br /><br />	The Works comprise of the construction of the marked footpath alignment shown on the tender drawings (Appendix A), generally following the lagoon perimeter and island loop. The primary path is to be a 2.5 m wide cycle/pedestrian concrete path. Tenderers must verify the alignment, dimensions, levels, interfaces and quantities before pricing and construction.<br /><br />	The two existing Fiber-Reinforced Polymer (FRP) bridges identified on the Appendix A are to remain. No work to the bridge structures or bridge decks is included, except for neat pathway tie-ins and making good immediately adjoining the bridge approaches where required.<br /><br />	The footpath is to extend over the existing rock bridge to the south of the site with the path t...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Whitsunday Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523085<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
