<guid isPermaLink="false">35b7df9c57884fd09c364b96552c905b</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 03:51:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.</category>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
</item>
<item><title>Land Maintenance</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Contractor shall provide all labour, plant, equipment and supervision necessary to complete the Works safely <br /><br />and compliantly.<br /><br />The Contractor shall undertake routine and ad hoc land maintenance activities including:<br /><br />• Routine slashing, mowing and brush-cutting of access tracks and infrastructure (existing built assets and<br /><br />operational surrounds) areas<br /><br />• Weed control including herbicide application<br /><br />• Minor vegetation management (tree & brush trimming/pruning) on access roads and tracks<br /><br />• Removal of debris and obstructions<br /><br />• Fireline maintenance including, slashing, vegetation removal and hazardous tree removal.<br /><br />• Reactive works following weather, growth or other impacting events<br /><br />• Minor maintenance of fencing and gates where minor defects are observed during works.<br /><br />• Ad hoc maintenance activities able to be completed with available equipment (e.g. minor gate / padlock <br /><br />maintena...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland Hydro<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 02/Oct/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523772<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
