<item><title>Fleet Renewal Program</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Livingstone Shire Council is seeking tenders for the supply and delivery of twelve (12) utility vehicles, including all accessories, fit-out, documentation, warranties and associated requirements necessary to provide the vehicles in accordance with the Contract and Technical Specification.<br /><br />The fleet renewal includes a combination of 2WD and 4WD utility vehicles, including extra cab and dual cab configurations, as detailed in the Tender Documents.<br /><br />The Contract will be administered under Council's Goods and Services Agreement. Council may award the vehicles in whole or in part and delivery may occur in stages, subject to the requirements and delivery timeframes specified in the Tender Documents.<br /><br />All vehicles supplied must be new, fit for purpose and fully compliant with the Technical Specification at the time of delivery.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Livingstone Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 21/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523434<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Vehicles<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
