<item><title>Contract 2025998 Design &amp; Construction of Ophir Road, Ophir - Traffic Bridge</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council is seeking tenders from appropriately qualified and experienced contractors for the Design and Construction of Ophir Road, Ophir - Traffic Bridge.<br /><br />All plant, equipment, labour and materials required for the construction will be supplied by the successful Tenderer as part of the Contract. The work shall be completed as a minimum to Australian Standards, the National Construction Code and Cabonne Council standards and provide long-term functionality. The construction work associated with this project shall be completed on time, within budget and without incidents.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Cabonne Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 30/Sep/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523376<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Alice Hazelton Email: alice.hazelton@cabonne.nsw.gov.au Tel: 63907162<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
