<item><title>Request for Quotation: Security Services for New Year’s Eve 2026-27</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Security services provided across seven fenced NYE vantage sites, supported by NSW Police, from various times on 31 December 2026 to 1am on 1 January 2027. <br /><br />Services includes pre-event planning meetings with event stakeholders including Woollahra Council staff and NSW Police, and a post event review.<br /><br />Parks & anticipated (maximum) crowd numbers:<br /><br />1.	Yarranabbe Park – max 10,000 (gated, alcohol free)<br /><br />2.	McKell Park – 1,000 (gated, alcohol free)<br /><br />3.	Dumaresq Reserve – 250 (gated, alcohol free)<br /><br />4.	Rose Bay Foreshore - 2,500 (gated, alcohol free)<br /><br />5.	Duff Reserve - 100 (gated, alcohol free)<br /><br />6.	Redleaf grounds and Murray Rose Pool – 1,000 (gated, alcohol free)<br /><br />7.	Queens Ave Vaucluse - 200 (gated, alcohol free)<br /><br />Detailed specifications, with site maps are provided in attached documents.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Woollahra Municipal Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Sep/2026 10:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523286<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Security Services & Equipment<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
