<item><title>Wide-bore CT Scanner suitable for Radiation Oncology</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Townsville Hospital and Health Service is seeking offers for the supply, delivery, installation, commissioning, testing, training, warranty support, and maintenance support for a Radiation Oncology CT Simulation System.<br /><br />The procurement is critical to maintaining continuity of safe, reliable and contemporary diagnostic imaging services and supporting ongoing clinical requirements, including radiation oncology planning, interventional procedures and general medical imaging across Townsville and North Queensland, following the existing equipment reaching end of life in 2023.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Townsville Hospital and Health Service QLD<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Sep/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523261<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Healthcare Services, Medical Equipment. & Supplies<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 14]]></description>
