<item><title>Request for Quotation: Waste Management Services for New Year’s Eve 2026-27</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Carry out waste management and cleaning services within Woollahra Council parks and adjoining areas on New Year’s Eve 2026 and New Year’s Day 2027 ensuring that the Parks are kept to a high standard over the New Year Period. <br /><br />Carry out waste management and cleaning services within the parks (refer below) on New Year’s Eve 2026 and New Year’s Day 2027. <br /><br />Council requires most of these services to be carried out on New Year’s Eve in order to reduce the workload on the following day. <br /><br />All cleaning work will need to cease no later than 2.00am New Year’s Day and not commence again prior to 6.00am on New Year’s Day. <br /><br />Parks will be open to the public for general use on New Year’s Day and must be clean of all litter, bottle tops, broken glass etc. as early as practicable to ensure they are safe for public use.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Woollahra Municipal Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Sep/2026 10:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523201<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Waste Management & Landfill<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
