<category>Waste Management &amp; Landfill</category>
</item>
<item><title>Design &amp; Construct 6.5m-7m Vessel Package Karumba ‘Nassau’</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Primary Industries, Queensland Boating and Fisheries Patrol (QBFP) seeks to commission a new 6.5 to 7 metre aluminium fisheries patrol vessel and offroad capable trailer to operate effectively in Queensland’s Gulf of Carpentaria waters. This vessel will be used for long range patrols operating in both shallow coastal foreshores and offshore waters between Kowanyama and the NT border including the Wellesley Island group.<br /><br />The new vessel is expected to deliver a service life of 10 years, offering robust, efficient, and reliable operations with enhanced seakeeping capabilities, ease of operation, and maintenance.<br /><br />INDUSTRY BRIEFING<br /><br />This RFQ has an optional industry briefing via Microsoft Teams on Wednesday, 9 September 2026 at 11.00am.<br /><br />Please register for the Industry Briefing via email no later than 2.00pm, Tuesday, 8 September 2026 via FandFprocurement@dpi.qld.gov.au. <br /><br />The following registration details are required: company name; name, ema...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Primary Industries<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523009<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Marine Transp. Products & Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.com.au/tsi.axd?id=55ba0694fe374995bee60fcd4413edb4s523009s6845ca88bf954fec83be2c7b557fe55fs1584</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">55ba0694fe374995bee60fcd4413edb4</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 01:02:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Marine Transp. Products &amp; Services</category>
