<item><title>Supply and Delivery of Waste Handling Wheel Loader</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Hinchinbrook Shire Council (Council) invites tenders from suitably qualified and experienced suppliers for the supply and delivery of a waste handling wheel loader for use within Council’s Waste and Resource Recovery operations.<br /><br />The procurement forms part of Council’s fleet replacement program and is intended to replace Council’s existing 2019 JCB 427HT Wheel Loader (Asset No. PA00466). The replacement machine will undertake demanding waste handling activities including the loading, pushing, stockpiling and movement of waste and recyclable materials, together with the formation and maintenance of batters, pads and other operational areas within Council’s waste facilities.<br /><br />Due to the harsh operating environment, Council requires a robust, fit-for-purpose machine specifically designed or suitably equipped for continuous waste and landfill operations. The proposed machine is to have an operating weight generally within the 16–20 tonne range and incorporate appropriate waste-handling feature...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Hinchinbrook Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 22/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522763<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Plant & Equipment - Purchase<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
