<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Dear Sir/Madam<br /><br />An invitation is extended to you to submit a written tender for the Carmila Landfill Capping Rehabilitation Works. <br /><br />Tenders must be in accordance with the attached Specification and Criteria. Please ensure your written tender is lodged prior to the Closing Time, being 2pm Friday 25 September 2026 AEST.<br /><br />All specification, general enquiries and written tenders must be submitted via VendorPanel only. Please do not send tender directly to Project Managers, Project team members or other Council staff. All phone enquiry details will be forwarded to the Contracts & Procurement team as a matter of record.<br /><br />Thank you in anticipation of receipt of your written tender. You will be advised if you have been selected as a successful Respondent in due course.<br /><br />Kind regards<br /><br />Isaac Regional Council<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Isaac Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522486<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Environmental & Heritage Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 14]]></description>
