<item><title>Meter to Cash Solution and Implementation Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Energy Queensland Limited (EQL) is seeking proposals for Meter to Cash Solution and Implementation Services via SAP Ariba.<br /><br />Tenderers who wish to submit a response need to be registered as a Supplier on SAP Ariba. For more information, please see below. <br /><br />EQL is seeking implementation of a Meter to Cash solution that is cloud-native, highly scalable and compliant with Australian industry standards and regulatory requirements, particularly those set by AEMO and other industry bodies. <br /><br />Part A: Product<br /><br />The Meter to Cash Solution must be capable of supporting both Ergon Energy and Energex entities within a single instance, with company-specific business processes, configurations, and workflows where necessary, while also enabling shared processes where appropriate. <br /><br />Tenders must comply with the following mandatory criteria:<br /><br />- Australian Energy Market Capability<br /><br /> • Proposed solution is deployed in production within an Australian DNSP operat...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Energy Queensland Limited<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 30/Sep/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521941<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
