<item><title>T27006 – Hard Waste Collection, Transportation &amp; Disposal Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Contract No. T27006 – Hard Waste Collection, Transportation & Disposal Service<br /><br />Tenders are invited for the Collection and Transportation of Council’s Hard Waste Service.<br /><br />The Council is seeking the Services of a suitable contractor to provide kerbside collection, transportation and disposal services of bulky hard and green waste items for residents. Items will include for example: unwanted furniture, mattresses, electrical items, whitegoods, garden waste, and bicycles, prioritising recycling wherever possible, with only non-recyclable materials sent to landfill.<br /><br />NOTE: The Vendor Panel online forum closes five business days prior to the abovementioned tender closing date. Council reserves the right not to accept the lowest or any Tender, or part thereof. Tenders received after the closing time will not be considered.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Stonnington<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 21/Sep/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520268<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Waste Management & Landfill<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
